# Stall Out: "Tap target creature or Vehicle, then put three stun counters on it." Bot2's Ornithopter is tapped and gets three stun
# counters. In Bot2's next untap step the stun counter is removed instead of untapping (CR 122.1d), so it stays tapped with two
# counters. Bot1's own Ornithopter could be chosen too (any creature), but Bot2's Island is a land and is refused as a target.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Mox Pearl
Stall Out
Island x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island
Island x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
! Bot1.Hand.Stall Out.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Island)
Bot1.Hand.Stall Out.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Tapped = true
? Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Counters.Stun = 3
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
? Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Tapped = true
? Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Counters.Stun = 2

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Stall Out
